# 🚀 VSD Day 5 – RTL Constructs and Synthesis

## 👩‍💻 Implemented by Akshara Reddy

This repository contains my implementation and learning from **Day 5 of the VSD RTL Design and Synthesis workshop**.

## 📌 Topics Covered

* Case statements
* IF statements
* Complete and incomplete assignments
* Latch inference
* MUX implementation
* DEMUX implementation
* Generate constructs
* Partial case assignment
* Ripple Carry Adder
* RTL Simulation
* GTKWave waveform analysis
* Basic Yosys synthesis

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* Verilog HDL
* Icarus Verilog
* GTKWave
* Yosys

## ⚠️ Note

**SKY130 technology mapping was not performed in this project.**

